# Play lessons

IIFE registering via `SD.lesson({...})`. Engine DSL: `play/engine/dsl.js`. Icons: `play/engine/icons.js`.

## Required shape

- `id` kebab-case, unique; must match filename stem and a `<script src="lessons/<file>.js">` in `play/index.html`
- ~8–12 steps; each step has `short`, `chapter`, `title`, `body[]`, `scene: { entities, links, flows }`
- Prefer entity helpers (`alice`, `api`, …) and link helpers with `labelAt` + `labelSide`
- Tags via `red`/`green`/`amber`/`note` — never pass a raw object as a link `label` (`both`/`link`/`gp` first arg is the string)

## Layout

- Spread entities on the grid (±3 to ±8) instead of stacking tags
- Dense tags: `pills: "below"` on blocks; stagger `labelAt` (0.28 / 0.55 / 0.72); put parallel requests on opposite `labelSide`
- Keep tag text short; avoid duplicate identical pills on neighbors
- After visual edits: `node --check play/lessons/<file>.js` then layout scan skill

## Content tone

Interview / defensive. Show attack shape, then control. No live exploit steps or payloads meant for unauthorized use.
